tComponent","areaName":"Nationwide","schema":{"id":25564}},"xpmMetadata":{"componentId":"tcm:108-74792","title":"BNY Mellon Equity NWALX-Overview-RTC-3col"},"content":{"componentMargin":{"margin":"large"},"componentWidth":"Full","rtcSection":[{"headerWidth":"Full","header":{"fragments":["\u003Ch2 class=\"nw-heading-tiempos-md nw-fg-rebrand-vibrant-blue\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Overview\u003C/h2>"]},"columnWidth":"33/33/33","paragraph":[{"bodyText":{"fragments":["\u003Ch3 class=\"nw-heading-sm\">Objective\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Seeks total return, consisting of capital appreciation and/or income.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Enhanced value:\u003C/strong> Actively managed relative-value strategy, bolstered by a derivative overlay designed to enhance bull market returns and lessen downside volatility. \u003C/p>"]}},{"bodyText":{"fragments":["\u003Ch3 class=\"nw-heading-sm\">Key features\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Unique divided approach:\u003C/strong> Combines sustainable high current income with solid dividend growth without sacrificing value\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>High-conviction, excess-return-driven-process:\u003C/strong> 50-80 stocks designed to deliver positive benchmark and peer relative results\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Derivative overlay:\u003C/strong> Employs an overlay that seeks to enhance returns by implementing modest leverage through S&P 500 Index® & Bond Futures\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003C/div>"]}},{"bodyText":{"fragments":["\u003Ch3 class=\"nw-heading-sm\">Fund documentation\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"https://nationwidefinancial.com/media/pdf/MFM-3502AO.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Fact sheet\u003C/a>: Share classes A and/or IS\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"https://nationwidefinancial.com/media/pdf/MFM-3503AO.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Fact sheet\u003C/a>: Share classes R6, R, IS, S, and/or Eagle\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"https://nationwidefinancial.com/media/pdf/MFM-5103AO.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Attribution report\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"https://nationwidefinancial.com/media/pdf/MFM-5089AO.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Quarterly investment commentary\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>"]}}],"applyFullBleedBGColor":[]}]}},{"id":"74794-60722","component":{"itemId":74794,"schemaId":60721,"title":"BNY Mellon Equity NWALX-Add'l Resources-Container 2 col","multiMedia":false,"itemType":16,"initialPublishDate":"2026-07-30T20:29:30.309Z","id":"e6c42eec-5627-3d0d-b7aa-15c74aa7c3b0","creationDate":"2024-04-26T14:08:26.000Z"},"mvcData":{"viewName":"TilesContainer","areaName":"Nationwide","schema":{"id":60721}},"xpmMetadata":{"componentId":"tcm:108-74794","title":"BNY Mellon Equity NWALX-Add'l Resources-Container 2 col"},"content":{"header":{"headerColor":"Vibrant Blue","subHeader":{"fragments":["\u003Ch3 class=\"nw-heading-sm\">Additional resources\u003C/h3>"]},"alignment":"left-aligned"},"tilesColumns":"2","seeMore":[],"tileItems":[{"componentId":74793,"content":{"tileLabel":"Regulatory documents","tileTargetUrl":{"externalLink":"https://nationwidefunds.onlineprospectus.net/nationwidefunds/MellonDUSEFund","target":"New Window","linkAttributes":[]},"tileContent":"Visit the site where the prospectus, reports, and other regulatory documents are located.","tileImage":{"svgContent":"svgContent"},"imageLocation":"left","imageBackgroundPosition":"center"},"model":"tile","id":60599}],"componentMargin":{"margin":"large"}}},{"id":"74796-29978","component":{"itemId":74796,"schemaId":25564,"title":"BNY Mellon Equity NWALX-Strategy-RTC-1col","multiMedia":false,"itemType":16,"initialPublishDate":"2026-07-30T20:29:30.309Z","id":"683707de-13e0-3221-abd5-8c419e54479b","creationDate":"2024-04-26T14:09:49.000Z"},"mvcData":{"viewName":"RichTextComponent","areaName":"Nationwide","schema":{"id":25564}},"xpmMetadata":{"componentId":"tcm:108-74796","title":"BNY Mellon Equity NWALX-Strategy-RTC-1col"},"content":{"componentMargin":{"margin":"large"},"componentWidth":"Full","rtcSection":[{"headerWidth":"Full","header":{"fragments":["\u003Ch3 class=\"nw-heading-sm\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Strategy overview\u003C/h3>"]},"paragraph":[{"bodyText":{"fragments":["\u003Cp>The Nationwide BNY Mellon Dynamic U.S. Equity Income Fund primarily focuses on delivering alpha through a relative-value approach that seeks a dividend yield greater than the broad U.S. equity market, but is enhanced by a derivative overlay that deploys S&P 500® Index and U.S. Treasury futures to magnify returns in a bull market and lessen volatility in a down market. The team's all-weather, fundamental and highly risk-controlled investment process targets a balance of dividend yield and dividend growth to maximize total return and generate consistent performance. Its proprietary bottom-up research allows the team to assess a company's ability and willingness to pay dividends, while also focusing on equities with attractive valuations relative to the market, sector and stock history. The valuation sensitivity and income generation allow for greater downside protection.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>The team believes successful investing is achieved through a philosophy that is value-oriented, research-driven and risk-controlled:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Value-oriented\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Focus on equity securities with attractive valuations relative to the market, sector and stock history\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Avoid the value trap and \"being early\" by combining traditional valuation measures with companies that exhibit business improvement and strong fundamentals\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>Research-driven\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Use proprietary fundamental research resources that understand the past but are focused on the future\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Recognize that one size does not fit all; be flexible in performing analyses so as to solve for the right company, sector and macro variables\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>Risk-controlled\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Employ risk controls at all levels of the portfolio-construction process to minimize unintended exposures and ensure performance is driven by stock selection\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Set up/down price targets ahead of establishing new positions\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>"]}}],"applyFullBleedBGColor":[]}]}},{"id":"73856-70590","component":{"itemId":73856,"schemaId":70587,"title":"SHARED-Fund management-NFW-8999AO-anchor","multiMedia":false,"itemType":16,"initialPublishDate":"2026-07-30T20:29:30.309Z","id":"7a146965-e3bd-3a61-9ef8-d6303b0fb7ad","creationDate":"2024-03-29T17:53:00.000Z"},"mvcData":{"viewName":"AnchorLink","areaName":"Nationwide","schema":{"id":70587}},"xpmMetadata":{"componentId":"tcm:108-73856","title":"SHARED-Fund management-NFW-8999AO-anchor"},"content":{"anchorLinkId":"fund-management","urbo":{"urboNumber":"NFW-8999AO"}}},{"id":"73922-29978","component":{"itemId":73922,"schemaId":25564,"title":"Shared-FundMgmt-H2-PortfolioMgmt-H3-RTC","multiMedia":false,"itemType":16,"initialPublishDate":"2026-07-30T20:29:30.309Z","id":"b8d717d5-e75c-3a3c-90f2-784c4da22ae9","creationDate":"2024-04-01T16:13:29.000Z"},"mvcData":{"viewName":"RichTextComponent","areaName":"Nationwide","schema":{"id":25564}},"xpmMetadata":{"componentId":"tcm:108-73922","title":"Shared-FundMgmt-H2-PortfolioMgmt-H3-RTC"},"content":{"componentWidth":"Full","rtcSection":[{"headerWidth":"Full","header":{"fragments":["\u003Ch2 class=\"nw-heading-tiempos-md nw-fg-rebrand-vibrant-blue\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Fund management\u003C/h2>"]},"paragraph":[{"bodyText":{"fragments":["\u003Ch3 class=\"nw-heading-sm\">Portfolio management\u003C/h3>"]}}],"applyFullBleedBGColor":[]}]}},{"id":"71817-29978","component":{"itemId":71817,"schemaId":25564,"title":"inv-SHARED-partners-newton-rtc","multiMedia":false,"itemType":16,"initialPublishDate":"2026-07-30T20:29:30.309Z","id":"cac68942-d63e-3c7b-b049-f39daf0f7f77","creationDate":"2024-01-08T15:41:44.000Z"},"mvcData":{"viewName":"RichTextComponent","areaName